### GET all departments

GET http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department

###

### GET a department by id


GET http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department/15


###



### Error 1 = POST a new department without name

POST http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "budget": 1000
}



###

### Error 2 = POST a new department with a negative badge

POST http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Videojuegos",
  "budget": -1
}



###


### Error 3 = POST a new department with a negative badge and empty name

POST http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "budget": -1
}



###

### POST a new department

POST http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Videojuegos",
  "budget": 10000
}

###

### Editar departamento (caso correcto, debe dar 200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "videojuegos2",
  "budget": 150.0
}

### Editar con nombre vacío (debe dar 400 con invalid-params)
PUT http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "budget": 150.0
}

### Editar con presupuesto negativo (debe dar 400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "videojuegos2",
  "budget": -5
}

### Editar un id que no existe (debe dar 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "nuevo",
  "budget": 100.0
}

### Borrar departamento (correcto, normalmente 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department/1

### Borrar un id que no existe (debe dar 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tempus/api/department/999



